SUMMARY:Tuesdays in the Plaza at Healdsburg Plaza
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy Tuesdays in the Plaza at Healdsburg Plaza from May 26–August 25\, every Tuesday from 6–8 PM. This popular summer concert series features an eclectic lineup of live music spanning a variety of genres\, creating a lively community atmosphere in the heart of downtown Healdsburg.    Guests can enjoy local food vendors beginning at 5 PM\, along with family-friendly activities\, dancing\, and outdoor fun throughout the evening. Bring a blanket or lawn chair and experience one of Healdsburg’s favorite summer traditions filled with music\, great food\, and Wine Country charm.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/tuesdays-in-the-plaza-at-healdsburg-plaza/
LOCATION:Healdsburg Ave & Matheson St, Healdsburg, CA, 95448, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Family Friendly,Live Music,Music,Outdoors,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
