SUMMARY:Sundays in Sonoma at Viansa Winery
DESCRIPTION:Viansa Winery feels made for live music\, perched atop the Summit of Sonoma with sweeping vineyard views and Tuscan-inspired charm. This summer and fall\, acclaimed singer-songwriter Greg Lamboy brings his warm\, intimate sound to the hilltop terrace for select afternoon performances as part of Viansa’s outdoor music series.    An award-winning guitarist and frontman of the Americana band Pacific Standard\, Lamboy is known for pitch-perfect melodies and deeply personal lyrics. His relaxed\, soulful style pairs effortlessly with Viansa’s panoramic setting\, estate wines\, and laid-back elegance.    Settle in with a tasting\, take in the views\, and enjoy an afternoon where strong vocals\, masterful guitar\, and unforgettable songs rise above the everyday.    Performance Dates:  June 14\, June 21\, July 12\, July 19\, July 26\, October 4\, and October 18 from 12 pm -3 pm.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/sundays-in-sonoma-at-viansa-winery/
LOCATION:25200 Arnold Drive, Sonoma, CA, 95476, United States
GEO:-122.4517203;38.2084947
CATEGORIES:Drink,Live Music,Music,Outdoors,Performing Arts,Sonoma County,Wine
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/02/19203901/Screenshot-2026-02-19-223640.png
