SUMMARY:Family Day at Robert Ferguson Observatory
DESCRIPTION:Families with children 12 and under are invited to enjoy a fun and educational day exploring the wonders of our solar system at the Robert Ferguson Observatory. This special program features hands-on activities\, interactive learning\, and outdoor adventures designed to spark curiosity about the planets\, the Sun\, and our cosmic neighborhood.    Advance tickets are required\, and attendance is limited to ensure a great experience for all guests. Children must be accompanied by an adult chaperone. Visitors are encouraged to bring sun protection and water\, as part of the program takes place outdoors. Families may also enjoy the nearby picnic area before activities begin.    It’s a memorable day of discovery\, learning\, and celestial fun for young explorers.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/family-day-at-robert-ferguson-observatory/
LOCATION:2605 Adobe Canyon Rd, Kenwood, CA, 95452, United States
GEO:-122.5349658;38.4415574
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Outdoors,Sonoma County
