SUMMARY:Solstice Tasting at Emeritus Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the Summer Solstice with a rare tasting featuring all five wines from the Pinot Hill vineyard. This special\, once-a-year experience highlights the unique character of the site\, including a side-by-side comparison of Pinot Hill East and West to explore the influence of morning and afternoon sunlight.    Guests will gain a deeper understanding of how subtle vineyard variations shape flavor\, making this an engaging and educational tasting.    Offered only once annually\, this exclusive event is a must for wine enthusiasts looking to experience Pinot Hill in a truly distinctive way.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/solstice-tasting-at-emeritus-vineyards/
LOCATION:2500 Gravenstein Hwy. North, Sebastopol, CA, 95472, United States
GEO:-122.855695;38.429441
