SUMMARY:Summer Solstice Celebration at St. Francis Winery
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the Summer Solstice\, the longest day of the year at St. Francis Winery &amp; Vineyards with a relaxed\, family-friendly evening on the Grand Lawn. Guests can enjoy lush vineyard views\, award-winning Artisan Collection wines\, and live music while connecting with family and friends.    A fan-favorite food truck will serve crave-worthy fare\, and lawn games like Corn Hole and Giant Jenga add a playful touch\, encouraging laughter and friendly competition. This seasonal celebration is the perfect way to unwind and soak in the charm of Sonoma Wine Country while welcoming the start of summer.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/summer-solstice-celebration-at-st-francis-winery-vineyards/
LOCATION:100 N. Pythian Road, Santa Rosa, CA, 95409, United States
GEO:-122.5781526;38.4355191
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Family Friendly,Food,Food & Wine,Live Music,Music,Outdoors,Sonoma County,Wine
